### Run these ONLY against your own local server (localhost), never against cynbit.in

### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Valid contact
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "message": "Hello, this is a test message." }

### Invalid contact (expect 422)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "a", "email": "bad", "message": "x" }
